WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:02.669
Nathan, you've
missed so much.

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.797
The town's revamp,
my 18th birthday.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:06.673
I did send
you that Cameo

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.924
from Olivia
Rodrigo's horse.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:09.843
That horse did not
phone it in.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.469
I love an animal who
knows her angles.

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:13.972
Reagan, I really
need your help.

00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:16.182
Nathan, you had a little
bit of a rough patch,

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:19.394
but adversity
makes us stronger.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.353
No Reags,

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.646
is this sweater
too sexy?

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:22.731
For what?

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.149
What about vest?

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:25.066
Welcome to the new

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.068
Minishonka
Cultural Center.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:28.403
This is Nelson,
my co-curator.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.863
You're touching those
with bare hands?

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.156
Would you want to be
touched with

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.490
with hands
covered in gloves?

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:34.159
You don't know
what I'm into, man.

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.869
Nice to see
you, Ms. Fish.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.537
I listened to that
podcast about you.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:38.872
I have Josh's info if
you want to dox him.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.206
Well I find
that troubling.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.374
Hey, Terry.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.584
Regan's in a Rez fight.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.169
Oh, tell her she hits
the ground it's over.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.962
Listen, Matriarch
to Matriarch.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.805
That is bonker donkers.

